    "%lld+": {},
    "%lld.": {},
    "/%@/": {},
    "1 problem to fix": {},
    "A finished session shows its last output, and can be restarted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une session terminée affiche sa dernière sortie, et peut être relancée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A process from that run may still be running (pid %@) and was left alone; check Activity Monitor.": {
      "comment": "Process identifiers, separated by commas.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un processus de cette exécution tourne peut-être encore (pid %@) et n’a pas été touché ; vérifiez dans le Moniteur d’activité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template is a prompt with fields to fill in — “Review {{url}}” — ready to start a session from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un modèle est un prompt avec des champs à remplir — « Revue {{url}} » — prêt à lancer une session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A transcript is no longer found; what it reported until %@ is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un transcript est introuvable ; ce qu’il indiquait jusqu’au %@ est conservé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couleur %@"
