          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les notes n’ont pas pu être enregistrées : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session could not be put back on %@: it stays on %@, and Restart will start it with a summary.": {
      "comment": "The agent the switch left, then the one it switched to. Restart is a command.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The session could not be put back on %1$@: it stays on %2$@, and Restart will start it with a summary."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La session n’a pas pu revenir à %1$@ : elle reste sur %2$@, et « Relancer » la démarrera avec un résumé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session is back on %@.": {
      "comment": "An agent's name.",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La session est revenue à %@."
          }
        }
